{"items":[{"id":"1643611321785712640","title":"问了问周围的朋友","content":"<p>问了问周围的朋友。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;经济衰退的速度有点超乎预料</p>","excerpt":"问了问周围的朋友","voteupCount":92,"commentCount":26,"created":1684647475,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1643611321785712640"},{"id":"1642631272106196992","title":"我的快乐，就很简单","content":"<p>我的快乐，就很简单。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;看到知乎后台的赞和关注，以及公号的阅读，就会有一种小小的满足感。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f4f6fc7695b201bd458759281dfcb263_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"974\" height=\"277\">","excerpt":"我的快乐，就很简单","voteupCount":76,"commentCount":10,"created":1684413813,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1642631272106196992"},{"id":"1642451372707741696","title":"澳洲的哥们给我打电话","content":"<p>澳洲的哥们给我打电话。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;澳洲现在好卷啊，我好累啊。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;听到这儿，我还想着咋安慰他一下，但就在想着，这哥们下句话就把我整破防了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我一周现在得干3天了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：(=_=)……</p>","excerpt":"澳洲的哥们给我打电话","voteupCount":96,"commentCount":13,"created":1684370922,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1642451372707741696"},{"id":"1641528191100547072","title":"亲测","content":"<p>亲测。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;收租的一万块确实比打工的两万块幸福感来得强。</p>","excerpt":"亲测","voteupCount":112,"commentCount":10,"created":1684150818,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1641528191100547072"},{"id":"1640806286894911488","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-d4d33895f9303e187943af519a488bdf_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1454\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":116,"commentCount":8,"created":1683978703,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1640806286894911488"},{"id":"1640488989936418817","title":"现在看我身上6%收益的保险，越看越高","content":"<p>现在看我身上6%收益的保险，越看越高。</p>","excerpt":"现在看我身上6%收益的保险，越看越高","voteupCount":36,"commentCount":8,"created":1683903054,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1640488989936418817"},{"id":"1638928687298072577","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-4e034e7c3efdd34575a8c6f3b8491bd9_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1576\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":19,"commentCount":6,"created":1683531048,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1638928687298072577"},{"id":"1635976364208574464","title":"跟我外婆出去吃饭，我问我外婆: 婆，这个…","content":"<p>跟我外婆出去吃饭，我问我外婆:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;婆，这个西瓜你还吃不吃了？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;外婆:不吃了&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我:免费的哦 (๑•̀ω•́๑) &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;外婆:吓？那你给我弄这个盘装双盘(●'◡'●)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我:好(✧∇✧)</p>","excerpt":"跟我外婆出去吃饭，我问我外婆: 婆，这个…","voteupCount":76,"commentCount":6,"created":1682827160,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1635976364208574464"},{"id":"1635698087464161280","title":"我现在很不理解五一带孩子出去见世面的说…","content":"<p>我现在很不理解五一带孩子出去见世面的说法。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我敢打包票，世面见不到，只能见到人。</p>","excerpt":"我现在很不理解五一带孩子出去见世面的说…","voteupCount":115,"commentCount":14,"created":1682760813,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1635698087464161280"},{"id":"1635007949109248000","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-ed2f50dd3886b6cacf24898f7a281ead_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"866\" height=\"78\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":38,"commentCount":9,"created":1682596272,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1635007949109248000"}]}